          Base URL for User Media Files Store View  A path that points to the location of catalog images and other media files. A placeholder is used to represent the base URL. If your Commerce installation has multiple sites with the same folder structure, you can have a different media folder for each. This gives you the ability to back up and roll back each media folder separately. You can also specify a media folder outside of your Commerce installation.
